SupportYourApp is a global Intelligent Support-as-a-Service leader, providing business process outsourcing services to other IT companies. We operate globally, supporting clients in 60 languages, partnering with top-tier industry players like MasterCard, Calm, McLaren, and MacPaw. We have international hubs and offices, and develop innovative products - Quidget and SupportCRM - to improve the customer experience every single day.
About position:
We’re looking for a Freelance Recruiter to conduct full cycle recruitment process from the the first conact to offer stage. In this role, you’ll play a key part in evaluating talent and ensuring a smooth candidate experience.
To be successful in this role, you need to ensure we offer a positive candidate experience and meet our hiring needs.
Excited? Let’s see what it takes 💛
What you will do:

• Manage the full recruitment cycle: from application to job offer;

• Monitor automated hiring flows and step in where a personalized approach is needed;

• Conduct interviews for roles that follow the standard hiring process;

• Assess candidates' communication skills, experience, and overall fit for the role;

• Provide detailed feedback on interviewed candidates;

• Keep candidate data accurate and up to date in the ATS;

• Communicate with candidates throughout the hiring process, ensuring a positive candidate experience;

• Be an ambassador of SupportYourApp and promote the company’s brand and values.

What you need to succeed in this role:

• Excellent communication skills of written and spoken English (C1+);

• Experience with Workable ATS is a must ;

• At least 1−2 years of the Talent Acquisition or Recruiter experience;

• Good time management skills with the ability to juggle various open positions;

• Experience with recruiting candidates through different job websites;

• Sourcing skills;

• Open, easy-going personality.

Will be a great plus:

• Knowledge of AI recruiting tools;

• Any other foreign language knowledge is a plus.

Benefits:

• Flexible hours;

• Opportunity to cooperate fully remotely;

• Inclusive international environment;

• Compensation in USD;

• Bonuses for referring friends;

• Greenhouse conditions for self-development.

You can learn more about the team and culture by visiting our official website and social pages on Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn.
Are you a people-oriented professional who believes that even in an automated process, a human touch makes all the difference?
